The Heart of the Forest~
   You have reached the heart of the forest.  The sounds of all the
creatures of the woods flow into your ears and seem to swirl around
inside you.  The openness of the glade lets you look straight up the
side of the gigantic oak before you, its branches spread like welcoming
arms; surely this must be the meeting place of all the druids in the
land.  The branches are placed so that any creature could climb the
great tree.  The glade lies north.
