#25590
ObsidMagi Hall~
A large meeting hall, lit by a circle of candles encompassing the Magi
book of pure wisdom, the book of evil. In the center of the floor a moon
has been encrusted into the floor, made of silver there is a star etched
just south of the moon, this is the symbol of the Dark Magic...The symbol
of ObidMagi. The walls are adorned in dark purple tapestries...a remnant of
the eternal darkness of the clan.
~
